      "role": "user",
      "content": "u sure though? it's just that it came on so fast, like literally seconds. normally my migraines take a bit to build up and i get nausea, but this one just hit me instantly and my neck feels kinda stiff too. u think that's just from the pain or could it be something else? i'm just really hoping it's just a bad migraine so i dont have to deal with the hospital bill.",
