      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk i'm still kinda nervous. my head is pounding so hard i feel like i might throw up and the light is really bothering me. if i take that big dose of ibuprofen and aspirin you suggested, is that safe to do alongside my usual prescription for sumatriptan? i take that for my migraines too. i just want to make sure i can just stay home and ride this out.",
